00:19:22.080 --> 00:19:23.790
What?!

00:19:23.790 --> 00:19:24.700
We lost?!

00:19:24.700 --> 00:19:26.490
No way...

00:19:26.490 --> 00:19:29.950
It was Jonouchi's first time as lead,
and Maeshima had just come back from a break,

00:19:29.950 --> 00:19:32.540
so you didn't get as many
points as you though, huh?

00:19:32.540 --> 00:19:37.080
But if the entertainment points
from the judges were added,

00:19:37.080 --> 00:19:39.830
who knows what would've happened?

00:19:39.830 --> 00:19:41.410
Don't look so scary.

00:19:41.410 --> 00:19:42.870
See you at a match.

00:19:42.870 --> 00:19:43.240
Coach--

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:43.870
We should--

00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:44.910
Go home, too--

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:45.450
Right away--

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:45.950
To analyze--

00:19:45.950 --> 00:19:46.700
And practice.

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:48.950
R-Right...

00:19:48.950 --> 00:19:52.200
Even though they're my own kids,
when they talk suddenly, it's surprising.

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:53.870
All right, I've decided!

00:19:53.870 --> 00:19:56.160
I'm going to switch to skate-leading, too!

00:19:56.160 --> 00:19:57.290
Huh? But--

00:19:57.290 --> 00:20:00.240
My rival is Shinozaki, after all.

00:20:00.240 --> 00:20:02.540
In order to decide things between us,

00:20:02.540 --> 00:20:05.200
I'll aim for number one with a team.

00:20:05.200 --> 00:20:07.740
Most importantly, it looks fun!

00:20:08.990 --> 00:20:11.080
Looks like the prince is heading home.

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:12.540
I'll head out, too.

00:20:12.540 --> 00:20:14.040
Okay, later.

00:20:14.040 --> 00:20:16.450
You've got a pretty good team there.

00:20:16.450 --> 00:20:19.580
Don't you think it'd be fun to train them?

00:20:29.700 --> 00:20:31.790
U-Um...

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:35.200
About Maeshima and Sasugai dropping out...

00:20:37.990 --> 00:20:40.450
Don't be late to morning practice tomorrow.

00:20:40.450 --> 00:20:41.950
Huh? Does that mean--?

00:20:41.950 --> 00:20:45.830
What? You're letting them join
even though we won?

00:20:45.830 --> 00:20:47.950
That's what the captain decided.

00:20:47.950 --> 00:20:50.410
But I hate you.

00:20:50.410 --> 00:20:54.330
You're only being allowed to join
because Terauchi acknowledged you.

00:20:54.330 --> 00:20:57.870
If you cause trouble again,
you'll be removed on the spot.

00:20:57.870 --> 00:20:59.490
Is that you being a sore loser?

00:20:59.490 --> 00:21:00.330
What did you say?

00:21:00.330 --> 00:21:02.160
I'll help you, Kiriyama, sir!

00:21:02.160 --> 00:21:02.780
Thanks.

00:21:02.780 --> 00:21:04.040
Me, too! Me, too!

00:21:04.040 --> 00:21:06.830
Hey, didn't you say you wanted
to get along the other day?!

00:21:06.830 --> 00:21:09.490
Don't fight right after joining the club!

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:11.370
I feel like I'm back at the club
from elementary school.

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:13.620
That is definitely not the case.

00:21:18.700 --> 00:21:20.660
A few days later

00:21:20.950 --> 00:21:26.990
Hey, Sasu? I was looking for your name
to register you for the club,

00:21:26.990 --> 00:21:29.540
but I can't find you
in the registry of first years.

00:21:29.540 --> 00:21:30.580
Do you know what's going on?

00:21:30.580 --> 00:21:31.450
Huh?

00:21:31.450 --> 00:21:34.910
Of course I'm not there.
I haven't officially transferred here yet.

00:21:34.910 --> 00:21:35.740
What?!

00:21:35.740 --> 00:21:38.830
Then, when you bet dropping out of school...

00:21:38.830 --> 00:21:41.740
It's annoying to do all the paperwork
to transfer twice, you know?

00:21:41.740 --> 00:21:43.790
That's why I left it until now,

00:21:43.790 --> 00:21:45.790
but man, I panicked a little

00:21:45.790 --> 00:21:48.290
when Maeshima said he'd also drop out.

00:21:48.290 --> 00:21:49.740
You know what?

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:51.200
It turned out all right, so it's fine, right?

00:21:51.200 --> 00:21:52.990
It's not "all right"!

00:21:54.490 --> 00:21:55.870
Good morning!

00:21:55.870 --> 00:21:57.830
Hey.

00:21:57.830 --> 00:22:00.660
I'm sorry, Himekawa's not here yet...

00:22:00.660 --> 00:22:02.990
Oh, about Himekawa...

00:22:02.990 --> 00:22:05.990
He withdrew from school.

