00:23:35.990 --> 00:23:50.990
Next Time

00:23:35.990 --> 00:23:50.990
Inspiration

00:23:37.490 --> 00:23:38.100
Kurayoshi.

00:23:38.100 --> 00:23:39.580
What is it, Captain Himuro?

00:23:39.580 --> 00:23:40.950
Are you able to talk to Shinozaki?

00:23:40.950 --> 00:23:42.040
Yeah, somehow.

00:23:42.040 --> 00:23:42.440
Okay.

00:23:42.440 --> 00:23:42.950
Huh?

00:23:42.950 --> 00:23:44.200
You're in charge of Shinozaki.

00:23:44.200 --> 00:23:47.080
Stay with him at all times
and talk or deal with things for him.

00:23:47.080 --> 00:23:47.990
I can't do it.

00:23:47.990 --> 00:23:50.040
Kurayoshi, it's up to you. You do it.

00:23:50.040 --> 00:23:50.950
That's mean.
